# Data Spec 12.5 requires every team member and every demonstration run to work
# against identical data. Git line-ending conversion would defeat that: the
# generators write LF, and a Windows checkout without this file would produce
# CRLF working copies whose bytes differ from a Linux teammate's.
# Normalise to LF everywhere so a fixed seed really does mean identical files.
*.csv text eol=lf
*.py  text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf

# The source documents are the build contract; never touch their bytes.
*.pdf binary
